er does. Unknown requested methods or costs are your review responsibility, not grounds to reject a reasonable effect. Every generated ability declares shared reference parameters and complete-execution/progress/cancellation contracts, including escrow ownership and actual remaining work. Implement new physical mechanisms when needed. Food composition and processing provenance must trace real consumed inputs, with no label-only diversity. Review temporary pleasure and maintained satisfaction separately; never alter protected mental accounts or suppress basic nutrition. Describe observable paid effects and their replay representation, and require actual separate participant actions for social consent.\nThis is a fresh experiment: only its supplied current registry and physical facts are available for functional reuse. No historical skill catalogue or recipes are available. Prefer the smallest feasible executable version, with actual material, energy, process, knowledge and capability dependencies and measurable subsequent benefit or newly feasible behavior. Existing same-world functions require individual learning. Persistent processes must specify conserved inputs and outputs, conditions, progress, pause, cancellation, maintenance and provenance. Code reuse must be recorded separately from an independently proposed function. No era gate or time-based unlock applies. Registered rules already settle repeated observations and experiences in code; do not require repeated model review of established mechanisms.","output":[{"type":"reasoning","id":"rs_0d501ccf7ed0c9d6016b031b4f35e487d199a29f37402c2fea","summary":[],"content":[],"encrypted_content":"gAAAAABrAxtPRlx1cfVNFuo_bC0LIX8FoChG58n245orf82S_uYTYsziucsh9csISiSL6dVEEhoils_MI-HyOLJiLPCvxwOu6tv1-UJhzMAx-ZUzd3Mm4QWUaTs2cymetKpiY0j5zuIQJuyGOMg4VoP6a0bXMPeavk4hacQ-maixEo6udUTE6gCKMXZwRK8sILvcsc0NBrBSnDeF8qY8z3LCkkiliOcfe10U1uxlDsBKgIwhk0DQ78Cfy1jcf7LTLtkk_ZkgQTDOcwO6gP8bwXpMxdYRDViHoojJ_Ya6mKf9htpa63dyWP4QL1DoMpaMcM2_zlAuY